'' T69, RUN: after a procedure with ON LOCAL ERROR returns, an error in the caller reaches
'' the caller's handler -- fbc-modern's output. tiko jumped to the procedure's handler, in a
'' frame that had returned, and crashed.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/local-error-nest.bas -o tests/codegen/localerrnest.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/localerrnest.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: close: 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: open: 2
